"http://www.yongducamp.kr/bbs/content.php?co_id=note"},{"text":"동반입실이 가능한 반려견은 (5kg 이하)에 한하여 동반입실이 가능 하며 캠핑장내에서는 상시 목줄을 하셔야 합니다.(미 착용시 강제퇴실)","url":"http://www.yongducamp.kr/bbs/content.php?co_id=note"},{"text":"카라반은 반려동물의 동반 입실이 불가 합니다.","url":"http://www.yongducamp.kr/bbs/content.php?co_id=note"},{"text":"※ 데크위에서 불을 지피는것은 절대불가하며 훼손될 경우 데크전체 수리비 청구 합니다.","url":"http://www.yongducamp.kr/bbs/content.php?co_id=note"},{"text":"· 고용량의 전열기구(600W 이상) 사용을 자제하여 주세요.","url":"http://www.yongducamp.kr/bbs/content.php?co_id=note"},{"text":"(전기요, 장판, 전등 이외 전기히터, 그릴, 난로, 밥솥 등의 전열기구는 사용 불가)","url":"http://www.yongducamp.kr/bbs/content.php?co_id=note"}],"field_conditions":{"version":2,"status":"SURVEYED","parking":{"state":"UNKNOWN","mode":"UNKNOWN","tent_side":null,"cart_required":null,"shared_nearby":null,"drop_off_external":null,"auto_camping_sites":null},"shelter_setup":{"state":"UNKNOWN","max_tents":null,"max_tarps":null,"canopy_allowed":null,"note":null},"power":{"state":"SURVEYED","available":true,"limit_w":600,"regulatory_reference_w":null,"breaker_capacity":"2.7A","statutory_standard":false,"high_power_mention":null},"ground":{"state":"CONFIRMED","types":[{"type":"CRUSHED_STONE","count":12},{"type":"DECK","count":28}]},"charcoal":{"state":"SURVEYED","allowed":true},"firewood":{"state":"SURVEYED","allowed":true,"sold":true},"fire_pit":{"state":"SURVEYED","arrangement":"개별"},"site_size":{"state":"CONFIRMED","groups":[{"width_m":4,"depth_m":5,"count":20},{"width_m":5,"depth_m":7,"count":8},{"width_m":5,"depth_m":7,"count":12}]},"sanitary":{"state":"CONFIRMED","toilets_count":1,"showers_count":1,"sinks_count":1,"private_bathroom":false,"private_bathroom_state":"UNKNOWN","hot_water":"제공","note":"공용 화장실 1개소 / 샤워실 1개소"},"features":["SWIMMING_POOL","PLAYGROUND","EXPERIENCE","FOREST_TRAIL","VALLEY"],"rental_offers":[{"item":"텐트","price_krw":null,"deposit_krw":0,"note":"현장 대여 가능 품목"},{"item":"릴선","price_krw":null,"deposit_krw":0,"note":"현장 대여 가능 품목"},{"item":"화로대","price_krw":null,"